    "comp-m9x7t0jz8": {
      "html": "<h2 class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:40px; line-height:normal; text-align:center;\"><span class=\"color_43 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-family:futura-lt-w01-book,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:40px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">More about me</span></span></span></span></span></h2>",
      "skin": "WRichTextThemeSkin",
      "isQaMode": false,
      "fullNameCompType": "wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"
    },
    "comp-m9x7t0k53": {
      "html": "<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">I&rsquo;m a multidisciplinary artist and illustrator with over a decade of hands-on experience in the film industry, primarily as an onset scenic and props painter.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">I hold a Bachelor of Media Arts from Wintec and a Post-Graduate Diploma in Fine Arts from Massey University, and my career has taken me deep into the world of props, prosthetics, armour, hero weapons, and sets&mdash;especially through my work with Wētā Workshop and on large-scale productions like the Avatar sequels and East of Eden.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">My focus is on texture, realism, and screen-readiness, and I&rsquo;m skilled across a wide range of painting techniques&mdash;from airbrushing and spray painting to intricate hand detailing. I&rsquo;m known for maintaining high standards and a strong work ethic, and I bring a calm, friendly presence even under tight deadlines and pressure. I take pride in being a reliable, positive team member, whether I&rsquo;m on set or in the workshop.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">In addition to my technical skills, I&rsquo;ve led small teams, managed day-to-day operations, scheduled tasks, delegated work, and ensured every detail meets both creative and production demands. I&rsquo;ve also handled materials ordering, coordinated logistics, and supported admin and accounts processes&mdash;contributing to projects from both artistic and practical angles.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Outside of work, I keep active with swimming and bouldering, and I enjoy learning and speaking German.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">I continue to explore new ways of working creatively and collaboratively, <span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><a href=\"mailto:laurenlikestopaint@gmail.com?subject=Let's%20work%20together\" target=\"_self\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">get in touch</a></span> if you would like to work together.&nbsp;</span></p>",
      "skin": "WRichTextThemeSkin",
      "isQaMode": false,
      "fullNameCompType": "wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"
    },
